            "review_text": "Phil C\nDerby, United Kingdom61 contributions\n0\nExcellent service, very accommodating, great view of Ho Hoan lake\nMay 2017 • Couples\nWe were 4 hot, sweaty Brits in need of a drink and a snack. They were attentive from the start, the drinks were served suitably chilled and our food order was not long in coming and obviously done fresh to order. Refills were promptly delivered and conversation easy and light hearted. Not easy to find but worth the visit. Recommended!\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten June 2, 2017",
