            "review_text": "JD-the-expat\nPortland, Oregon17644 contributions\n0\nGreat food and service\nNov 2012 • Solo\nI totally agree with the first review for Mi Han Quoc, sensational. I had lunch here and had the Kimchi Soup (Giggae) - WOW was my impression, delicious, and not at all too spicy. This is a pork and kimchi soup that you shouldn't miss. Naturally, since this is Korean, you get many side dishes and even a sweet tea to finish off the meal. I recommend sitting on the balcony \n\nI will be back.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 5, 2012",
